---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 12 - Test jednego zdania"
  bgImage="/images/background-6.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.78), rgba(10,14,23,0.9))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="eyebrow"><i class="ti ti-quote"></i> Zasada praktyczna</span>
      <h1 class="title">
        Test <span class="highlight">jednego zdania</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="rule">
      <div class="rule-mark">
        <i class="ti ti-quote"></i>
      </div>
      <p>
        Jeśli nie potrafisz opisać kontenera w <strong>1–2 zdaniach</strong>, to albo
        <em>nie rozumiesz jeszcze architektury</em>, albo element jest
        <em>na niewłaściwym poziomie</em>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="examples">
      <article class="example good">
        <header>
          <span class="ex-tag good-tag"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Dobry przykład</span>
          <span class="ex-meta">≈ 25 słów · 1 zdanie</span>
        </header>
        <div class="container-pill">
          <i class="ti ti-cloud-cog"></i>
          <div>
            <strong>Orders API</strong>
            <span class="tech">[ASP.NET Core]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <blockquote>
          „Orders API — <mark>obsługuje składanie i śledzenie zamówień</mark>,
          <mark>publikuje zdarzenia domenowe</mark> po zmianie statusu,
          <mark>zapisuje dane w bazie zamówień</mark>."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="ex-check">
          <span class="check"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> nazwa</span>
          <span class="check"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> odpowiedzialność</span>
          <span class="check"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> komunikacja</span>
          <span class="check"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> dane</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="example bad">
        <header>
          <span class="ex-tag bad-tag"><i class="ti ti-x"></i> Niewystarczający</span>
          <span class="ex-meta">≈ 4 słowa · placeholder</span>
        </header>
        <div class="container-pill bad-pill">
          <i class="ti ti-box"></i>
          <div>
            <strong>OrderService</strong>
            <span class="tech bad-tech">[?]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="bad-quote">
          „OrderService — <mark class="bad-mark">obsługuje zamówienia.</mark>"
        </blockquote>
        <div class="diagnosis">
          <i class="ti ti-stethoscope"></i>
          <div>
            <span class="diag-label">Diagnoza:</span>
            <span class="diag-text">
              zbyt ogólne — prawdopodobnie to już <strong>poziom komponentów</strong>, nie kontenerów.
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1700px;
    padding: 70px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .eyebrow i { font-size: 18px; }

  .title {
    font-size: 76px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .rule {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    padding: 36px 56px 36px 100px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08), rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.05)),
      rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15), 0 22px 60px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.85s ease-out 0.35s forwards;
  }

  .rule-mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 32px;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.18);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .rule p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    text-align: left;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .rule strong {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .rule em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f8fafc;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .examples {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .example {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.6);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 26px 28px 28px;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.85s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .example.good {
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12), 0 16px 50px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.18);
  }

  .example.bad {
    animation-delay: 0.8s;
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.4);
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .example header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ex-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ex-tag i { font-size: 15px; }

  .good-tag {
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .bad-tag {
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.45);
    color: #f87171;
  }

  .ex-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  .container-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.5);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .container-pill i {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24px;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .container-pill strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .container-pill .tech {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  .container-pill.bad-pill {
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.5);
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .container-pill.bad-pill i {
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.4);
    color: #f87171;
  }

  .bad-tech {
    color: #f87171 !important;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
    border-left: 4px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.6);
    border-radius: 6px 14px 14px 6px;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  blockquote.bad-quote {
    border-left-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.6);
  }

  blockquote mark {
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.18);
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  blockquote .bad-mark {
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.15);
    color: #fca5a5;
  }

  .ex-check {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .check {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .check i { font-size: 14px; }

  .diagnosis {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.3);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .diagnosis i {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: #f87171;
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .diag-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f87171;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .diag-text {
    display: block;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .diag-text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f87171;
  }
</style>
